  "prefLabel": "Env-A 802.13 Compliance Stack Testing for Emissions of Nitrogen Oxides (NOx) or Carbon Monoxide (CO)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 802.13 Compliance Stack Testing for Emissions of Nitrogen Oxides (NOx) or Carbon Monoxide (CO). An owner or operator of a source required to conduct compliance stack testing for either NOx or CO shall simultaneously conduct compliance stack testing for both NOx and CO.\n\nSource. #12762, eff 5-1-19",
